Description: Add locale stub with explicit template instantiation for protoc-gen-js
 protoc-gen-js is a build tool that generates JavaScript bindings from
 Protocol Buffer files. It requires locale symbols from libc++ for iostream
 initialization, but the bundled libc++'s locale.cpp cannot be compiled on
 Debian due to type conflicts with glibc headers.
 .
 Missing symbols: std::__Cr::num_put::id, std::__Cr::codecvt::id
 .
 This patch:
 1. Adds a minimal stub implementation (cef_locale_stub.cpp) that uses
    explicit template instantiation to define the missing id static members.
 2. Links the stub into protoc-gen-js to provide the required symbols.
 .
 Since protoc-gen-js is a build tool that runs with LC_ALL=C and only outputs
 generated code, it doesn't need actual locale functionality.
 .
 Build 135: locale.cpp compilation proven impossible (__newlocale conflicts)
 Build 163c-164: System libc++ failed (ABI namespace mismatch __Cr vs __1)
 Build 165-170: Stub approach successful, but LTO stripped all symbols
 Build 171: Config removal failed (thinlto_optimize_default only controls level)
 Build 172c: cflags += failed (undefined identifier in GN executable() scope)
 Build 172d: Flags overridden by global config("compiler") which adds -flto=thin last
 Build 173: --undefined flags failed (no stub file created)
 Build 174: Explicit template instantiation to define id members (NEW APPROACH)
 .
 Investigation: ThinLTO strips symbols that aren't referenced. Solution: Use
 explicit template instantiation in a .cpp file to force the compiler to
 generate and emit the id static member definitions.
Author: Juan Manuel Méndez Rey <vejeta@gmail.com>
Bug-Debian: https://bugs.debian.org/915400
Forwarded: not-needed
Last-Update: 2025-11-14

diff --git a/third_party/protobuf-javascript/BUILD.gn b/third_party/protobuf-javascript/BUILD.gn
index d6fa1d7..5e8f1c2 100644
--- a/third_party/protobuf-javascript/BUILD.gn
+++ b/third_party/protobuf-javascript/BUILD.gn
@@ -12,6 +12,11 @@ if (current_toolchain == host_toolchain) {
       "src/generator/well_known_types_embed.cc",
       "src/generator/well_known_types_embed.h",
     ]
+
+    # Debian: Add locale stub for linking (avoids locale.cpp compilation issues)
+    sources += [
+      "//cef/debian/cef_locale_stub.cpp",
+    ]
     include_dirs = [ "src" ]
     deps = [
       "//third_party/protobuf:protoc_lib",
